  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ARM: English Language Training for the Ministry of Internal Affairs in Armenia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Given the strategic importance of the Ministry of Internal Affairs (MIA) in Armenia and its traditionally closed nature, delivering targeted training and supporting capacity development for its staff presents a valuable opportunity. This initiative will not only enhance the Ministry&#x2019;s operational capabilities but also foster deeper UK&#x2013;Armenia relations, paving the way for sustained bilateral engagement.</narrative>
  </description>
